Phase 1 will populate this directory with:
  _spmixw_demean.mata    - within-transformation
  _spmixw_ols.mata       - pooled / FE OLS
  _spmixw_simulate.mata  - DGP for tests

Each .mata file declares one function. The build script
(../build/build_mlib.do) compiles them into ../build/lspmixw.mlib.
